                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "685c4833-74f6-417f-bc46-f6c178c0e31f",
                        "source_entry_id": "1a23d238-da1e-334e-82e0-3b2bd2c90591",
                        "source_sense_id": "4a24b4f2-439a-3df7-ae60-d8e225e62fc0",
                        "target_lang_word": "xenophobic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "xenophobic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "70e33731-26fd-3068-8030-037523903bd8",
                                        "entry_id": "f191ac42-d6ef-32a4-b4f2-ce71874b1862",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Exhibiting or characterised by xenophobia, a fear or hatred of strangers, foreigners, or extraterrestial life."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a68d85c1-1863-4592-b2b6-2726231b8219",
                                                "sense_id": "70e33731-26fd-3068-8030-037523903bd8",
                                                "text": "Residents of Plettenberg Bay this week launched violent xenophobic attacks on foreign Africans living in informal settlements, beating them and ransacking their houses"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "baf7ab25-b122-44b7-8b9b-d39c5560f3bc",
                                                "sense_id": "70e33731-26fd-3068-8030-037523903bd8",
                                                "text": "It has not yet promised much in the way of serious debate about the migrant crisis or the EU’s failure to tackle it in a humane and coordinated manner, in the context of the Italian government’s increasingly xenophobic policies."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "146d972f-76d2-4ab3-a275-cea7a2ed2479",
                                                "sense_id": "70e33731-26fd-3068-8030-037523903bd8",
                                                "text": "Fox News Channel host Tucker Carlson, who often spreads xenophobic arguments, has ardently embraced the charge that Democrats are “trying to replace the current electorate – the voters now casting ballots – with new people, more obedient voters from the Third World.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "xenophobic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a8127ab7-e108-338e-be90-43d5b38119d6",
                                        "entry_id": "7445d39c-33fa-3ce7-b1b8-fad218fb2566",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A xenophobe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1028fd4-c618-4c39-9312-db4e63d1b4f0",
                                                "sense_id": "a8127ab7-e108-338e-be90-43d5b38119d6",
                                                "text": "So Buzz Bissinger sees fit that we give up on the ideal of Olympism and give in to xenophobics, terrorists, drug abusers, profiteers and human rights abusers?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a9ec792b-50d6-4ee0-81e1-01783760bd9b",
                        "source_entry_id": "1a23d238-da1e-334e-82e0-3b2bd2c90591",
                        "source_sense_id": "4a24b4f2-439a-3df7-ae60-d8e225e62fc0",
                        "target_lang_word": "xenofobní",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "xenofobní",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e90604e4-3b58-3eae-939d-90bfef5f3184",
                                        "entry_id": "4c36946f-f56e-3b0d-ac58-5edad2d78fc1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "takový, který nenávidí všechno neznámé či cizí, příp. se toho iracionálně bojí"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8522e291-0e37-4040-8475-ae283b6bc06f",
                                                "sense_id": "e90604e4-3b58-3eae-939d-90bfef5f3184",
                                                "text": "Dva z nich - aniž bychom házeli všechny politiky do jednoho pytle - před volbami rozvíjeli úvahy o „medúzách“ a „slimácích“. Tohle ohavné přitakávání xenofobním předsudkům je součástí atmosféry, ve které se rasistické urážky na sociálních sítích a bití v tramvaji stávají něčím nebezpečně přirozeným, součástí českého provozu."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "16c741a6-c594-460c-8930-227692a86a0a",
                        "source_entry_id": "1a23d238-da1e-334e-82e0-3b2bd2c90591",
                        "source_sense_id": "4a24b4f2-439a-3df7-ae60-d8e225e62fc0",
                        "target_lang_word": "xénophobe",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "xénophobe",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f5280b70-4fd1-3575-b4b9-0d799bc1a2ef",
                                        "entry_id": "f283febf-0ac2-3250-a523-fd8ba5b1af21",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui rejette ou qui déteste les étrangers ou ce qui provient de l’étranger."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e43cdfc-fa6e-4c35-9482-9dd7e600f86f",
                                                "sense_id": "f5280b70-4fd1-3575-b4b9-0d799bc1a2ef",
                                                "text": "En présentant l’islam et les musulmans comme un nouveau « fascisme », le « nazislamisme », les populistes hollandais reprennent à leur compte la méthode Fallaci, permettant de libérer toute la force de l’opinion xénophobe en l'arrachant aux partis d’extrême droite qui ont tenté de l'avoir en monopole. Mais ils ont échoué."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e12e968f-1827-4d22-895f-c4810578ba92",
                                                "sense_id": "f5280b70-4fd1-3575-b4b9-0d799bc1a2ef",
                                                "text": "Les stades sont aujourd'hui de plus en plus remplis de fils à papa, traders à la City. Leur hooliganisme à eux, s'est développé […], quand s'est libérée la parole xénophobe en Grande-Bretagne, europhobe et anti-immigration."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6cca3fa2-b694-41b6-b66b-f0b5eb9609f6",
                                                "sense_id": "f5280b70-4fd1-3575-b4b9-0d799bc1a2ef",
                                                "text": "Indifférent aux peurs xénophobes d’une partie de la société, l’hyper s’adapte à la diversité culturelle de la clientèle, suit scrupuleusement ses fêtes. Aucun éthique là-dedans, juste du « marketing ethnique »."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "xénophobe",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5cf87bca-264b-3707-851b-050aa16d605d",
                                        "entry_id": "dee4d478-6149-3cf5-9459-3f32a87b0212",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne qui éprouve un sentiment de rejet, à l’égard des étrangers ou ce qui vient de l’étranger."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "673b14db-f20d-4be7-b1da-54e1ce633494",
                        "source_entry_id": "1a23d238-da1e-334e-82e0-3b2bd2c90591",
